  "description": {
   "en": "\"Miss Judith, how about spending this summer at the Curtis estate in Wilz?\"  \nAfter five years of silence, her anonymous benefactor finally replied—with an invitation to meet.  \nJudith, a war orphan and secret esper, had fled to the Federation after her homeland’s defeat. In her painful life, the only warmth came from a mysterious benefactor.  \nShe never knew their name or face, but their generous gifts filled the void in her heart. Though she never received a reply, writing a monthly letter of gratitude became her cherished routine. So when the invitation arrived, she eagerly set off for Wilz.  \nThere, in the dazzling and dangerous city, she met three men: a charming rogue with an enigmatic smile, a successful businessman who cared for her, and a gang leader who clashed with her at every turn.  \nOne of them was her benefactor—but who?"
  },
